url: "https://data.orchid-project.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/orchid-calphad/orchid-data"
abstract: "One entry per phase of each binary system: every name it goes by (TDB, corpus, paper labels, Materials Project / OQMD ids), the CALPHAD models that describe it, where the calculated diagrams make it stable, example literature references, and a structure type assigned only when certain (standard name or unique DFT match), otherwise a review candidate list. Version 1, machine-extracted: values were read from papers by language-model readers constrained to quote their source and checked automatically (quote verification, field-placement rule, printed-page sign checks, DFT and Kim et al. 2017 cross-checks); a hand-checked precision sample is in progress."
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.PENDING-orchid-data"
    description: "Umbrella record ORCHID data (all datasets of release v2026.10)"
keywords: [CALPHAD, thermodynamics, phase diagrams, convex hull, DFT, formation enthalpy, AI-ready data]
